        392,
        487,
        1311,
        574
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a7 3. Schedules of the appropriations contained in the Mayor's Message which\naccompanied the Executive Budget, or of such appropriations as amended by the City\nCouncil and Board of Estimate in adopting the Expense Budget for the 1975-1976 fiscal\nyear are hereby approved.",
