      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a7 4. (a) All actions taken in accordance with the New York City Charter, subsequent to February 14, 1975, approving modifications of the supporting schedules as contained in the Mayor's 1975-1976 Budget Message are hereby carried over, effective July 1, 1975.",
