        1313,
        726
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "(b) All adjustments of rates of positions in accordance with the provisions of special pay plans or reallocations, effective but not implemented prior to June 30, 1975, are hereby included in the 1975-1976 Budget, effective July 1, 1975.",
